    - target: {fileID: 4158954359239545762, guid: fd28f23af44f73f4a95e33435872ad15, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Epoxy is a type of polymer, a group of chemical compounds that consist
        of large molecules with repeating subunits. The molecular structure of polymers
        give them their toughness and elasticity, making polymers (both natural and
        manmade ones) ubiquitous in daily life.\n\nThis tool can be used for structural
        blade repairs, corrosion protection, and sealing or insulating components
        against harsh weather and constant vibration\n\n "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
