    - target: {fileID: 4158954359239545762, guid: fd28f23af44f73f4a95e33435872ad15, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "A hammer is a tool, most often a hand tool, consisting of a weighted
        \"head\" fixed to a long handle that is swung to deliver an impact to an
        object. This can be used to drive nails into wood, to shape metal, or to
        crush rock\n\nThis tool can be used to tap blades and detect hidden fiberglass
        fractures, alongside general mechanical tasks like seating or aligning parts\n\n "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
